		<name>Octo</name>
		<summary>Music player for your Octo or Navidrome server</summary>
		<desc>Octo plays the music on your own server. It is made for Octo, a proxy that adds discovery to a Navidrome server, and it works with any Subsonic server too.

With Octo:

* Add songs, albums and search results you find to your library with one press.
* One search for everything: your music first, then what Octo found, all playable at once.
* Whole albums, with the songs you have marked and the rest one press away.
* Stations on Home, and radio that reaches past your library.

With any Subsonic server, it is a full player for the music you have: browse by artist, album, song, genre or folder, with favorites, ratings and playlists; synced lyrics, gapless playback, an equalizer with presets, ReplayGain and a sleep timer; and a queue that follows you between your phone and computer.</desc>
